---
title: Switch
description: Toggle for on/off settings, built on a native checkbox with role="switch" so it keeps form and keyboard behavior. Use for settings that apply immediately.
tags: [forms, accessibility, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<label class="switch">
  <input type="checkbox" role="switch" name="notifications">
  <span>Notifications</span>
</label>
